    }
  },
  "conversionNotes": {
    "subtype": "JavaScript and TypeScript pass the Subtype's base value without a proof field. Host callbacks returning a selected Subtype require withRecovery(callback, value); recovery is validated before callback entry and is never successful output. Returned Lean closures apply the selected constructor before their body."
